e mating type locus on chromosome III, as well as the fixation of the RM allele at the synthetic genetic array marker integrated at the CAN1 locus on the left arm of chromosome V.","article.html"],["LEU1","Extended Data Figure 3 legend","For this gene, 14 X-pQTL are called.","article.html"],["local","Extended Data Figure 4 legend","note that YMR315W and GCN1 were ‘local’ experiments where peaks at the gene position are visible.","article.html"],["FACS","Extended Data Figure 2 legend","The low GFP (blue) and high GFP (red) gates sample extreme levels of GFP within a defined range of cell sizes.","article.html"],["reproducibility","Supplementary Note 1","We performed replication experiments for 27 genes.","MOESM48_ESM.pdf"],["reproducibility","Supplementary Note 1","Across the 27 detection experiments, we discovered 240 X-pQTL at genome-wide significance.","MOESM48_ESM.pdf"],["reproducibility","Supplementary Note 1","The direction of effect was concordant at 234 (97.5%) of the X-pQTL.","MOESM48_ESM.pdf"],["eQTL","Supplementary Note 2","The analyses were restricted to the 701 X-pQTL that did not overlap a significant eQTL, were not located on chromosomes II and III, and were not located on the chromosome on which the given gene is located.","MOESM48_ESM.pdf"],["eQTL","Supplementary Note 2","We obtained an estimate of π = 36%.","MOESM48_ESM.pdf"]]},"a14:SD3":{"cols":["member","bytes_uncompressed","bytes_compressed"],"rows":[["2013-07-09744B-SupplementaryData_3_countData/","0","0"],["2013-07-09744B-SupplementaryData_3_countData/countData160Genes.txt","69920789","21203966"],["2013-07-09744B-SupplementaryData_3_countData/countDataLocalExperimentsCombined.txt","18280379","5518714"],["2013-07-09744B-SupplementaryData_3_countData/countDataReproducibility.txt","23376350","6977794"]]}}